-- ASEAN Cosmetic Directive -- the duties Comply4 checks, stated in L4.
--
-- Agreement on the ASEAN Harmonized Cosmetic Regulatory Scheme (Phnom Penh,
-- 2 September 2003), Schedule B, Articles 1 to 9 and 11, with Appendix II
-- (ASEAN Cosmetic Labeling Requirements, 4 September 2007).
--
-- STATUS: a working draft that travels with the console. It has not been
-- through the encoding-a-subject workflow, has no coverage table, fork register
-- or independent test pass, and is not filed under subjects/. It exists so that
-- every rule the console applies can be read in L4, and so that the console's
-- answers and the L4's answers are held to the same stated cases
-- (acd-cases.l4, generated by build.js).
--
-- Two-valued where the console is three-valued: here every fact is answered.
-- The Annexes are not encoded; whether a formula is within them is a fact.

§ `The facts`

DECLARE `Site of application` IS ONE OF
    `external parts of the body`
    `teeth or the mucous membranes of the oral cavity`
    `somewhere else`

-- Appendix II C.1 puts the particulars on the outer packaging, or on the
-- immediate packaging where there is no outer one. C.2 lets them move to a
-- leaflet, hang tag, display panel or shrink wrap where the container cannot
-- carry them.
DECLARE `Place on the label` IS ONE OF
    `on the packaging`
    `only on a leaflet or tag`
    `not shown`

DECLARE `Units of contents` IS ONE OF
    `metric`
    `metric and imperial`
    `imperial only`

-- What a colouring agent, preservative or UV filter that is off Part 1 of its
-- Annex relies on: Art 4(4), Art 5, or nothing.
DECLARE `Cover for unlisted substances` IS ONE OF
    `Part 2 of the Annex`
    `a national authorisation under Article 5`
    `nothing`

DECLARE Facts HAS
    -- You and your markets
    `you are the company or person responsible for placing the product in the market` IS A BOOLEAN
    `every regulatory authority concerned has been notified`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the product has been placed in the market`                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `a Member State has prohibited or conditioned the product under Article 11`      IS A BOOLEAN
    -- What the product is
    `where the product is applied`                                                   IS A `Site of application`
    `its exclusive or main purpose is a cosmetic one`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `it contains a substance listed in Annex V`                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Formula
    `the safety assessment concludes it does not damage human health`                IS A BOOLEAN
    `it contains a substance listed in Annex II`                                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `every Annex II substance is a trace unavoidable in good manufacturing practice` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it contains a substance listed in Annex III Part 1`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `every Annex III substance is within its limits and conditions`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `it contains colouring agents`                                                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `its colouring agents are intended solely to colour hair`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `every colouring agent is listed in Annex IV Part 1`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `every listed colouring agent is used within its conditions`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `it contains preservatives`                                                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `every preservative is listed in Annex VI Part 1`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `every listed preservative is within its limits and conditions`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the other concentration serves a specific purpose apparent from the presentation` IS A BOOLEAN
    `it contains UV filters`                                                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `every UV filter is listed in Annex VII Part 1`                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `every listed UV filter is within its limits and conditions`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `what covers the unlisted substances`                                            IS A `Cover for unlisted substances`
    `it bears the distinctive indication the authorisation defines`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Label
    `the container cannot carry all the particulars`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `where the name is shown`                                                        IS A `Place on the label`
    `its function is clear from its presentation`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `where the function is shown`                                                    IS A `Place on the label`
    `how to use it is clear from its name or presentation`                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `where the instructions are shown`                                               IS A `Place on the label`
    `where the ingredient list is shown`                                             IS A `Place on the label`
    `the ingredients are in the order Appendix II requires`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the ingredients are named from the standard references`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `it contains botanicals`                                                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the botanicals are identified by genus and species`                             IS A BOOLEAN
    `where the country of manufacture is shown`                                      IS A `Place on the label`
    `where the responsible company is shown`                                         IS A `Place on the label`
    `where the contents are shown`                                                   IS A `Place on the label`
    `the units the contents are given in`                                            IS A `Units of contents`
    `where the batch number is shown`                                                IS A `Place on the label`
    `its minimum durability in months`                                               IS A NUMBER
    `where the expiry date is shown`                                                 IS A `Place on the label`
    `where the manufacturing date is shown`                                          IS A `Place on the label`
    `the date is given as month and year or day month and year`                      IS A BOOLEAN
    `the expiry date is preceded by the words Appendix II suggests`                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `special precautions must be observed in use`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `where the precautions are shown`                                                IS A `Place on the label`
    `the name is on the immediate packaging`                                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the batch number is on the immediate packaging`                                 IS A BOOLEAN
    `the particulars are easily legible visible and clearly comprehensible`          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the particulars are indelible`                                                  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the particulars are in an accepted language`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `nothing in the labelling or advertising implies characteristics it lacks`       IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Claims
    `a benefit is claimed for it`                                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `the claims comply with the Claims Guideline`                                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `each claimed benefit is justified by evidence or the formulation`               IS A BOOLEAN
    -- Product information file
    `the file is readily accessible at the address on the label`                     IS A BOOLEAN
    `the file holds the qualitative and quantitative composition`                    IS A BOOLEAN
    `it contains a perfume composition`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the file identifies the perfume composition and its supplier`                   IS A BOOLEAN
    `the file holds the specifications`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `the file holds a method of manufacture complying with good manufacturing practice` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the person responsible for manufacture or importation is adequately qualified`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `the file holds the safety assessment`                                           IS A BOOLEAN
    `the file holds the existing data on undesirable effects`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the file holds supporting data for the claimed benefits`                        IS A BOOLEAN
    `the file is in a language the authority accepts`                                IS A BOOLEAN
    `the methods of checking ingredients are available to the authority`             IS A BOOLEAN
    `the microbiological and purity criteria are available to the authority`         IS A BOOLEAN

§ `Article 2 -- Definition and scope`

-- Art 2(1): a substance or preparation intended to be placed in contact with
-- the external parts of the body, or with the teeth and the lining of the
-- mouth, exclusively or mainly to clean, perfume, change the appearance of,
-- correct the odour of, protect or keep them in good condition.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the product is a cosmetic product` IF
        (    f's `where the product is applied` EQUALS `external parts of the body`
          OR f's `where the product is applied` EQUALS `teeth or the mucous membranes of the oral cavity`)
    AND f's `its exclusive or main purpose is a cosmetic one`

-- Art 2(3): a cosmetic product containing an Annex V substance is excluded
-- from the Directive; Member States deal with it as they see fit.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the Directive applies to the product` IF
        `the product is a cosmetic product` f
    AND NOT f's `it contains a substance listed in Annex V`

§ `Article 1 and Article 11 -- Getting to market`

-- Art 1(3) is addressed to the company or person responsible for placing the
-- product in the market, by name.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Article 1(3) binds you` IF
    f's `you are the company or person responsible for placing the product in the market`

-- Art 1(3): the notification is due before the product is placed in the
-- market. Until then an outstanding notification is due, not breached.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the time to notify has not passed` IF
    NOT f's `the product has been placed in the market`

-- Art 11(1): a Member State may provisionally prohibit a product that complies
-- with the Directive, or put special conditions on it.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `no Article 11 measure stands against the product` IF
    NOT f's `a Member State has prohibited or conditioned the product under Article 11`

§ `Article 3 -- Safety requirements`

-- Art 3(1). Whether a product damages health in normal or reasonably
-- foreseeable use is a judgement; the encoding takes the assessment's
-- conclusion as a fact.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the product meets the safety requirement of Article 3` IF
    f's `the safety assessment concludes it does not damage human health`

§ `Articles 4 and 5 -- Ingredients`

-- Art 4(2)(a): no Annex II substance. Art 4(3): a trace is allowed where it is
-- technically unavoidable in good manufacturing practice AND the product
-- conforms with Article 3.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the product is clear of Annex II` IF
        NOT f's `it contains a substance listed in Annex II`
    OR  (    f's `every Annex II substance is a trace unavoidable in good manufacturing practice`
         AND `the product meets the safety requirement of Article 3` f)

-- Art 4(2)(b). FORK: the text prohibits use "beyond the limits and outside the
-- conditions"; this takes either as enough, so the fact asks for both.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the restricted substances are within Annex III` IF
        NOT f's `it contains a substance listed in Annex III Part 1`
    OR  f's `every Annex III substance is within its limits and conditions`

-- At least one colouring agent, preservative or UV filter is off Part 1.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an unlisted substance is present` IF
        (`the colouring agent rules apply` f AND NOT f's `every colouring agent is listed in Annex IV Part 1`)
    OR  (f's `it contains preservatives`     AND NOT f's `every preservative is listed in Annex VI Part 1`)
    OR  (f's `it contains UV filters`        AND NOT f's `every UV filter is listed in Annex VII Part 1`)

-- Art 4(4): Part 2 substances are allowed within their limits until their end
-- dates. Art 5(1): a Member State may authorise an unlisted substance within
-- its territory for up to three years.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the unlisted substances are covered` IF
        f's `what covers the unlisted substances` EQUALS `Part 2 of the Annex`
    OR  f's `what covers the unlisted substances` EQUALS `a national authorisation under Article 5`

-- Art 4(2)(c) and (d) except products whose colouring agents are intended
-- solely to colour hair.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the colouring agent rules apply` IF
        f's `it contains colouring agents`
    AND NOT f's `its colouring agents are intended solely to colour hair`

-- Art 4(2)(c): only Annex IV Part 1 colouring agents; (d): within its conditions.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the colouring agents are permitted` IF
        f's `every listed colouring agent is used within its conditions`
    AND (   f's `every colouring agent is listed in Annex IV Part 1`
         OR `the unlisted substances are covered` f)

GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the preservative rules apply` IF
    f's `it contains preservatives`

-- Art 4(2)(e): only Annex VI Part 1 preservatives; (f): within its limits and
-- conditions, unless another concentration serves a specific purpose apparent
-- from the presentation of the product.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the preservatives are permitted` IF
        (   f's `every listed preservative is within its limits and conditions`
         OR f's `the other concentration serves a specific purpose apparent from the presentation`)
    AND (   f's `every preservative is listed in Annex VI Part 1`
         OR `the unlisted substances are covered` f)

GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the UV filter rules apply` IF
    f's `it contains UV filters`

-- Art 4(2)(g): only Annex VII Part 1 UV filters; (h): within its limits and conditions.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the UV filters are permitted` IF
        f's `every listed UV filter is within its limits and conditions`
    AND (   f's `every UV filter is listed in Annex VII Part 1`
         OR `the unlisted substances are covered` f)

-- Art 5(1)(c): a product made under a national authorisation must bear the
-- distinctive indication the authorisation defines.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the product relies on an Article 5 authorisation` IF
        `an unlisted substance is present` f
    AND f's `what covers the unlisted substances` EQUALS `a national authorisation under Article 5`

§ `Article 6 and Appendix II -- Labelling`

-- App II C.1 chapeau and C.2: a particular is properly shown on the packaging,
-- or on a leaflet or tag where the container cannot carry all the particulars.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
      place IS A `Place on the label`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is shown where Appendix II allows` IF
        place EQUALS `on the packaging`
    OR  (    place EQUALS `only on a leaflet or tag`
         AND f's `the container cannot carry all the particulars`)

-- C.1(a). FORK: "unless it is clear from the presentation" is read as excusing
-- the function only, so the name is always required.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the label shows the name` IF
    `is shown where Appendix II allows` f (f's `where the name is shown`)

-- C.1(a): the function, unless clear from the presentation of the product.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the label shows the function or it is clear` IF
        f's `its function is clear from its presentation`
    OR  `is shown where Appendix II allows` f (f's `where the function is shown`)

-- C.1(b): instructions on use, unless clear from the name or presentation.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the label shows the instructions or they are clear` IF
        f's `how to use it is clear from its name or presentation`
    OR  `is shown where Appendix II allows` f (f's `where the instructions are shown`)

-- C.1(c): full ingredient listing, in descending order of weight when added,
-- named from the latest edition of a standard reference.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the label carries a full ingredient listing` IF
        `is shown where Appendix II allows` f (f's `where the ingredient list is shown`)
    AND f's `the ingredients are in the order Appendix II requires`
    AND f's `the ingredients are named from the standard references`

-- C.1(d).
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the label shows the country of manufacture` IF
    `is shown where Appendix II allows` f (f's `where the country of manufacture is shown`)

-- C.1(e): the company or person responsible for placing the product on the
-- local market.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the label shows the responsible company` IF
    `is shown where Appendix II allows` f (f's `where the responsible company is shown`)

-- C.1(f): by weight or volume, in metric or in both metric and imperial.
-- FORK: imperial alone is read as not enough.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the label shows the contents in accepted units` IF
        `is shown where Appendix II allows` f (f's `where the contents are shown`)
    AND (   f's `the units the contents are given in` EQUALS `metric`
         OR f's `the units the contents are given in` EQUALS `metric and imperial`)

-- C.1(g).
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the label shows the batch number` IF
    `is shown where Appendix II allows` f (f's `where the batch number is shown`)

GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an expiry date is shown` IF
    `is shown where Appendix II allows` f (f's `where the expiry date is shown`)

-- C.1(h): the manufacturing date or the expiry date, as month and year or day,
-- month and year. An expiry date is mandatory where minimum durability is less
-- than 30 months -- so 30 months exactly does not require one.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the label shows a sufficient date` IF
        (   `an expiry date is shown` f
         OR `is shown where Appendix II allows` f (f's `where the manufacturing date is shown`))
    AND (   f's `its minimum durability in months` AT LEAST 30
         OR `an expiry date is shown` f)
    AND f's `the date is given as month and year or day month and year`

-- Art 6(2), C.1(i): special precautions to be observed in use, including the
-- warnings the Annexes require to be printed. Art 6(2) has no operative verb in
-- the text read; C.1(i) supplies the requirement.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the label shows the precautions` IF
    `is shown where Appendix II allows` f (f's `where the precautions are shown`)

-- C.2: whatever else moves to a leaflet, the name and the batch number stay on
-- the small immediate packaging.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the small container carries the name and batch number` IF
        f's `the name is on the immediate packaging`
    AND f's `the batch number is on the immediate packaging`

-- Art 6(1), C.3.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the particulars are legible and indelible` IF
        f's `the particulars are easily legible visible and clearly comprehensible`
    AND f's `the particulars are indelible`

§ `Articles 8 and 9 -- Product information`

-- Art 8(1) and Art 1(4) are addressed to the company or person responsible for
-- placing the product in the market.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Article 8 binds you` IF
    f's `you are the company or person responsible for placing the product in the market`

-- Art 8(1)(g): supporting data for claimed benefits. There is no (f) in the
-- text read. The item is worded "should be made available" inside a list the
-- company "shall keep"; it is treated as required where a benefit is claimed.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Article 8(1)(g) binds you` IF
        `Article 8 binds you` f
    AND f's `a benefit is claimed for it`

-- Art 8(1)(a): composition; for a perfume composition, its name and code
-- number and the identity of the supplier.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the file holds the composition` IF
        f's `the file holds the qualitative and quantitative composition`
    AND (   NOT f's `it contains a perfume composition`
         OR f's `the file identifies the perfume composition and its supplier`)

-- Art 9 is addressed to the same company or person.
GIVEN f IS A Facts
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Article 9 binds you` IF
    f's `you are the company or person responsible for placing the product in the market`
